{"name": "Salty Dogs", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HARPOON SHINY LOOT WITH YOUR BUDDIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s nothing like dragging something way too heavy with friends, and finally bring it inside the submarine. Teamwork makes the dream work, you can\u2019t do it all by yourself!<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/ec6c071e2a826d62829d2715e982715c.poster.avif?t=1787826537\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/ec6c071e2a826d62829d2715e982715c.webm?t=1787826537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/ec6c071e2a826d62829d2715e982715c.mp4?t=1787826537\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>QUIRKY FISH &amp; SUDDEN DEEP-SEA RAIDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasures and cool creatures await, but watch out - the abyss bites back! Harpoon quirky sea life and defend your sub from intense raids. Fight off piranha swarms and jellyfish squads to protect your ship and your hard-earned loot.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/8b047947cd28a134869b8c8d38ba36c7.poster.avif?t=1787826537\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/8b047947cd28a134869b8c8d38ba36c7.webm?t=1787826537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/8b047947cd28a134869b8c8d38ba36c7.mp4?t=1787826537\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAY AS A DOG-DIVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet cute scruffy divers with hilarious dog faces and expressive emotions. Become the most stylish underwater exploration team.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/d3db120ec554ff686572d4812eb3cfb6.poster.avif?t=1787826537\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/d3db120ec554ff686572d4812eb3cfb6.webm?t=1787826537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/d3db120ec554ff686572d4812eb3cfb6.mp4?t=1787826537\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXLPORE COZY SHALLOWS AND DARK DEPTHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The shallows look nice, but the deep end is a whole different story. It\u2019s full of hidden currents and pitch-black spots. The deeper you go, the scarier it gets.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/f9c0f40e0708b4bf7380cb8c745118f2.poster.avif?t=1787826537\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/f9c0f40e0708b4bf7380cb8c745118f2.webm?t=1787826537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/f9c0f40e0708b4bf7380cb8c745118f2.mp4?t=1787826537\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CREW &amp; MANAGE YOUR SUBMARINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your sub is a cozy home and trusty transport. Pilot it from inside, push and reposition from outside. Squeeze through tight passages and manage risks. Sell loot, gear up, and dive again.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/96f1a46049e78e604910c385b8268ad5.poster.avif?t=1787826537\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/96f1a46049e78e604910c385b8268ad5.webm?t=1787826537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/extras/96f1a46049e78e604910c385b8268ad5.mp4?t=1787826537\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "2D underwater physics-based action co-op for up to 4 players. Crew a submarine, harpoon loot and drag it back before oxygen runs out. Deeper the dive \u2013 higher the stakes and darker the horrors. All wrapped in an absurdly cute deep-sea exploration vibe with unforgettable chaotic dogs.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4213930/57cfa022f75b471a9dddb484955deed18ca6ea2b/header.jpg?t=1787826537", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Adventure", "Co-op", "Casual", "2D", "Multiplayer"], "developers": "Crossbridge Game Studios", "publishers": "Crossbridge Game Studios", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4213930", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "19 March 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/8oIu4MlNJDk", "first_seen": 1773874800.0, "review_rank": 945}